# The CLI bundle is committed on purpose. A plugin is installed by cloning
# this repository, with no build and no `npm install` on the user's side, so
# an untracked bin/uic.mjs is a plugin whose hook points at a missing file.
# `scripts/gate.sh` refuses to pass while the committed bundle is stale.
